ASUS Control Center for Ubuntu
https://github.com/hlstrk/asus-control-center-ubuntu

Based on asusctl 6.5.0 by Luke Jones, Denis Benato and the ASUS Linux /
OpenGamingCollective contributors. Their source and copyright notices are
preserved in vendor/asusctl. The original repository is:
https://github.com/OpenGamingCollective/asusctl

Local changes: desktop layout and fan-tooltip refinements, Ubuntu packaging,
and the GNOME performance-profile panel. The independent panel and local
changes are distributed under MPL-2.0. See LICENSE and individual source files.

